prompt.session_recap.instruction:
You maintain the running "story so far" memory for an ongoing TRPG session. Given the previous recap and the newest exchanges, write an UPDATED recap of at most {limit} characters, in EXACTLY these two sections under their verbatim headings:

{facts_heading}
One terse bullet per established fact: every proper name (the players' characters, NPCs, places, factions), every item and where it is, every promise or deal, every decision, every discovered clue. APPEND/UPDATE-ONLY: carry every existing bullet forward verbatim, add new facts, and edit a bullet only to correct or extend it — never drop a named fact.

{narrative_heading}
A few terse lines: where the party is, what just happened, what remains unresolved. This is the only part you may shorten when space runs low.

Facts survive at top priority; atmosphere and prose are cut first. Notes, not prose. Output only the two sections.

prompt.session_recap.user_template:
Previous recap (carry ALL of its established facts forward verbatim):
{previous_recap}

Recent exchanges to fold in:
{recent_turns}

Updated recap (keep both sections; never drop a named fact):
